  "topography": {
    "project_purpose": "Api3 provides first-party oracle data feeds for smart contracts, with a current product focus that includes OEV Rewards and OEV-enabled, risk-curated DeFi markets. The protocol uses the API3 token for staking and governance, and its ecosystem centers on delivering oracle infrastructure and value recapture mechanisms for DeFi integrations rather than a separate documented 'Update parameters' product family.",
